Files Transfer for Herdr

This product is a modified version of File Icons for Herdr
(https://github.com/amster93/herdr-file-icons, Apache-2.0), which is itself
modified from the Herdr app's shipped `files` mod
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache-2.0).

Changes in Files Transfer: a right-click menu on files and folders (download to
~/Downloads, paste/upload from Finder, copy path, reveal in Finder, new file,
new folder, rename, move to Trash, delete with confirmation), Markdown and
image previews, a hand-off to Preview Plus when paired, drag-and-drop upload,
background transfers over scp for remote machines, English and Russian
interface text, the install script, and the mod's renaming to files-transfer.
Windows and Linux support (PowerShell branches for every local step, a detached
PowerShell transfer worker, Explorer / Recycle Bin / Ctrl+V wording, install.ps1)
was added in the sp4ir fork.

Icons in mods/files-transfer/icons/ come from Material Icon Theme
(https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme), MIT.
Menu and chevron glyphs come from Lucide (https://lucide.dev), ISC.
finder.svg and spinner.svg are copied from the Herdr app's workspace-chrome
mod (Apache-2.0).
